    source: GT 2021, tr. 28-31
    chapterId: tthcm-ch1
    prompt: "Gi\xE1o tr\xECnh n\xEAu m\u1EA5y \xFD ngh\u0129a c\u1EE7a vi\u1EC7c h\u1ECDc t\u1EADp m\xF4n T\u01B0 t\u01B0\u1EDFng H\u1ED3 Ch\xED Minh?"
    explanation: "C\xF3 ba \xFD ngh\u0129a: n\xE2ng cao n\u0103ng l\u1EF1c t\u01B0 duy l\xFD lu\u1EADn; gi\xE1o d\u1EE5c v\xE0 \u0111\u1ECBnh h\u01B0\u1EDBng th\u1EF1c h\xE0nh \u0111\u1EA1o \u0111\u1EE9c c\xE1ch m\u1EA1ng; x\xE2y d\u1EF1ng, r\xE8n luy\u1EC7n ph\u01B0\u01A1ng ph\xE1p v\xE0 phong c\xE1ch c\xF4ng t\xE1c."
