    explanation: "\u0110\xF3 l\xE0 mong mu\u1ED1n: x\xE2y d\u1EF1ng m\u1ED9t n\u01B0\u1EDBc Vi\u1EC7t Nam h\xF2a b\xECnh, th\u1ED1ng nh\u1EA5t, \u0111\u1ED9c l\u1EADp, d\xE2n ch\u1EE7 v\xE0 gi\xE0u m\u1EA1nh, v\xE0 g\xF3p ph\u1EA7n x\u1EE9ng \u0111\xE1ng v\xE0o s\u1EF1 nghi\u1EC7p c\xE1ch m\u1EA1ng th\u1EBF gi\u1EDBi."
    promptVN: "Mong mu\u1ED1n cu\u1ED1i c\xF9ng c\u1EE7a H\u1ED3 Ch\xED Minh \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c gi\xE1o tr\xECnh tr\xEDch d\u1EABn l\xE0 g\xEC?"
    explanationVN: "\u0110\xF3 l\xE0 mong mu\u1ED1n: x\xE2y d\u1EF1ng m\u1ED9t n\u01B0\u1EDBc Vi\u1EC7t Nam h\xF2a b\xECnh, th\u1ED1ng nh\u1EA5t, \u0111\u1ED9c l\u1EADp, d\xE2n ch\u1EE7 v\xE0 gi\xE0u m\u1EA1nh, v\xE0 g\xF3p ph\u1EA7n x\u1EE9ng \u0111\xE1ng v\xE0o s\u1EF1 nghi\u1EC7p c\xE1ch m\u1EA1ng th\u1EBF gi\u1EDBi."
    options:
    - id: A
      text: "To\xE0n \u0110\u1EA3ng to\xE0n d\xE2n \u0111o\xE0n k\u1EBFt ph\u1EA5n \u0111\u1EA5u x\xE2y d\u1EF1ng m\u1ED9t n\u01B0\u1EDBc Vi\u1EC7t Nam h\xF2a b\xECnh, th\u1ED1ng nh\u1EA5t, \u0111\u1ED9c l\u1EADp, d\xE2n ch\u1EE7 v\xE0 gi\xE0u m\u1EA1nh"
